<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How HisaabLab handles calculator inputs, technical data, contact email and potential future advertising." noindex={true}>
  <section class="simple-page"><div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Home',href:'/'},{label:'Privacy Policy'}]} /><div class="simple-page-grid"><nav><a href="#current">Current version</a><a href="#inputs">Calculator inputs</a><a href="#hosting">Hosting data</a><a href="#ads">Future advertising</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav><article class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</span><h1>Privacy, described as the site actually works.</h1><p>Last updated: 3 November 2026. This baseline policy should receive legal review before a public launch.</p><h2 id="current">Current version</h2><p>HisaabLab does not require an account, has no application database and does not intentionally collect calculator inputs. The site is designed as a static application.</p><h2 id="inputs">Calculator inputs</h2><p>Values entered into calculators are processed locally in your browser. Shareable-result links can place values in the URL only when you choose Share. URLs may appear in browser history and can be seen by anyone with whom you share them, so avoid using sensitive details.</p><h2 id="hosting">Hosting and technical data</h2><p>The eventual hosting provider may process ordinary request data such as IP address, timestamp, requested page, device or browser information and security logs. The final host and retention settings must be documented here before launch. HisaabLab does not currently send individual financial inputs to analytics.</p><h2>Contact email</h2><p>If you email HisaabLab, the configured email provider processes the content and address you submit. Do not include sensitive account or identity data.</p><h2 id="ads">Future advertising and consent</h2><p>Advertising support is disabled by default. If Google AdSense or another service is enabled later, this policy must be updated to identify the service, cookies or storage used, purposes, retention, transfers and user choices. Consent management must be configured where required, including applicable Google consent requirements. Enabling an environment variable alone does not establish legal compliance.</p><h2>Children and security</h2><p>The tools address general household financial planning and are not directed to children. No internet transmission can be guaranteed completely secure.</p><h2 id="contact">Questions</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. The public contact address is supplied through launch configuration rather than invented in this document.</p></article></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
